9e319008.webp?t=1731879868\" width=615 height=38 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/b0edf4157214d28ed94511553e1819e9.webp?t=1731879868\" width=615 height=38 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Immersive Simulation</strong>: Explore a fully simulated computer world where each command holds significance.<br></li><li><strong>Strategic Challenges</strong>: Navigate threats, unlock secrets, and outsmart adversaries through strategic decision-making.<br></li><li><strong>Hack, Survive, Conquer</strong>: Test your hacking skills, survive in a dynamic environment, and strive to conquer this virtual realm.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/7a3f1ae3c2f4ba7d025fd72285573f48.poster.avif?t=1731879868\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/7a3f1ae3c2f4ba7d025fd72285573f48.webm?t=1731879868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/7a3f1ae3c2f4ba7d025fd72285573f48.mp4?t=1731879868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/b0edf4157214d28ed94511553e1819e9.webp?t=1731879868\" width=615 height=38 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/809981b2d3df3d4b62cbd04090a04aa4.webp?t=1731879868\" width=615 height=38 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/b0edf4157214d28ed94511553e1819e9.webp?t=1731879868\" 